@startuml
title Dovetail Engine Lifecycle (swimlanes = owning component)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
  DiamondBorderColor #1F2937
  DiamondFontColor #111827
}

|#DBEAFE|Caller|
start
:Receive typed seed terms\nand rewrite rules; <<#DBEAFE>>

|#BBF7D0|E-graph · `egraph` + `rules`|
:Validate `SemanticHash`\nexact-key contract; <<#BFDBFE>>
:Build exact-keyed e-graph\nwith length-framed identity; <<#BBF7D0>>
:Run saturation iterations\n(`AcApp` AC matching when present); <<#DCFCE7>>
if (terminal outcome?) then (Converged)
  :Use saturated graph as complete\nfor the chosen bounds; <<#DCFCE7>>
elseif (NodeLimit)
  :Report node budget boundary; <<#FEE2E2>>
elseif (IterationLimit)
  :Report iteration boundary; <<#FFEDD5>>
endif

|#FEF3C7|Automaton · `wta`|
:View e-graph as weighted tree automaton; <<#FEF3C7>>
:Compute inside weights\nand cyclic SCC closure when requested; <<#FDE68A>>

|#FBCFE8|Extractor · `extract`|
:Order child keys with\norder-preserving framing; <<#CCFBF1>>
:Extract derivations through\nchecked best-first stream; <<#FBCFE8>>
if (cycle cut?) then (yes)
  :Return BoundedByCycleCut; <<#FFEDD5>>
else (no)
  :Return Complete; <<#BBF7D0>>
endif

|#EDE9FE|Report · `report`|
:Build substrate-neutral run report\nwith saturation and extraction metadata; <<#EDE9FE>>

|#DBEAFE|Caller|
:Dispatch report to oracle,\nRho backend, or tooling; <<#FCE7F3>>
stop

legend right
|= Box color |= Area |
|<#DBEAFE> | Inputs — typed terms and rewrite rules |
|<#BBF7D0> | Identity — exact-keyed e-graph construction |
|<#DCFCE7> | Saturation — equality evidence growth |
|<#FEF3C7> | Automaton — weighted-tree interpretation |
|<#CCFBF1> | Ordering — framed child-key ordering |
|<#FBCFE8> | Extraction — checked derivation stream |
|<#EDE9FE> | Report — substrate-neutral handoff |
|<#FEE2E2> | Boundary — explicit bounded outcome |
endlegend
@enduml
